<title>USA: U.S. approves TIS products for export.</title>
<headline>U.S. approves TIS products for export.</headline>
<dateline>GLENWOOD, Maryland 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trusted Information Systems said Monday that products using cryptography with its RecoverKey technology had received approval for &quot;general purpose export control&quot; under new export regulations from the Commerce Department.</p>
<p>The new regulations determine whether or not hardware and software products that use methods to decode encrypted messages can be exported outside the country.</p>
